  "description": "The Vamoose HONDO is a cut above the rest. With top-tier components including Tektro Dorado quad piston brakes, SRAM X5 9-speed derailleur, Rockshox rear suspension, and air front suspension, as well as distance leading 52V 20Ah battery with the dual-battery option, this cycle is a high-performing beast.FULL SUSPENSION & FULL POWERThe Vamoose HONDO comes in two models: the all-wheel drive dual 52V 750W version or a mid-drive 1000W BAFANG M620 version. Both provide incredible torque and power to climb steeper hills, tear through deep snow, tow a heavy load, or carve up logging trails with ease. This is the HONDO MID-drive version.This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• 1000W Bafang 620 mid-motor\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery with additional battery optional\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• Torque sensor\n\n• Hydraulic Tektro Dorado quad piston brakes\n\n• Front and rear LED lights\n\nSPECIFICATIONSSPECIFICATIONS\n\nMotor Format:\nSingle-MID\n\nFront Motor:\nN/A\n\nMid Motor:\nBAFANG M620 1000W\n\nRear Motor:\nN/A\n\nDerailleur and shifters:\nSRAM X5 9 SPEED\n\nThrottle:\nTwist Throttle w/o shut off\n\nDisplay:\nBAFANG DPC18\n\nBattery:\n21700 50 E CELLS 52V 20 Ah Samsung\n\nCharger:\n4A SMART\n\nFront forks :\nGTMRK air with travel stop 140mm travel, lockout and adjustable rebound\n\nRear Suspension:\nRockshox DELUXE SELECT 190845\n\nDropper Seat Post:\n\nFrame:\nLRG 6061 Aluminum with Trailer Eylets and Piggy-back mount on downtube\n\nWheels:\n26\" x 4.8\" MAXXIS MINION FBR FBF\n\nPedals:\nGYBEARING Aluminum\n\nSaddle:\nNebula Gel\n\nFront and Rear Racks:\nRear, with front mount option\n\nFenders:\nPlastic\n\nFront and rear lights:\nLED Wired\n\nADDITIONAL ATTRIBUTES\n\nTorque (per motor):\n120 Nm MAX Torque\n\nWatt Hours:\n1040\n\nMiles per charge:\n52\n\nKms per charge:\n83.68568\n\nBattery charge time:\n4-6 hrs.\n\nUSB Plugin:\nYES\n\nWEIGHTS AND DIMENSIONS\n\nBox dimensions (cm):\n168 x 32.5 x 86.5\n\nBox dimensions (inch):\n66 X 13 X 34\n\nWeights (metric):\n43kg NW / 52 kg GW\n\nWeights (imperial):\n95 lbs NW / 115 lbs GW\n\nMax Speed (metric):\n32 km/h max speed\n\nMax Speed (imperial):\n20 m/h max speed\n\nMax Load:\n330 lbs.",
